random and this query is measured, and the \emph{S} works by running
\emph{A}, but with the following modifications. First, one of the
\emph{q} + 1 queries of \emph{A} (also

\begin{quote}
measurement outcome \emph{x} is output by (the first stage of) \emph{S}.
Then, this very query of \emph{A} is answered either using the original
\emph{H or} using the reprogrammed oracle \emph{H ∗Θx}, with the choice
being made at random, while all the remaining queries of \emph{A} are
answered using oracle \emph{H ∗Θx}.9Finally, (the second stage of)
\emph{S} outputs whatever \emph{A} outputs.

Here, the figure of merit is the probability that for a fixed \emph{x},
