Pr \emph{x}=\emph{x◦∧v} = \emph{accept} : (\emph{x, v}) \emph{←⟨SA, V⟩}
≳\emph{O}(\emph{q}2) Pr \emph{x}=\emph{x◦∧VH F S}(\emph{x, π}) :
(\emph{x, π}) \emph{←AH} \emph{.}
\end{quote}

